    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 10 December 2002 a welfare-placement agreement was signed between R.P. and the social care home for adults with mental disorders near the village of Pastra in the municipality of Rila (“the Pastra social care home”), an institution under the responsibility of the Ministry of Labour and Social Policy."@en .

